Third-party components
----------------------
models/RM_IHPSG13_1P_64x16_c2.v and models/RM_IHPSG13_1P_core_behavioral.v are
unmodified SRAM simulation models from IHP-Open-PDK
(https://github.com/IHP-GmbH/IHP-Open-PDK, revision
2bbec755dc67ca3db0261c3d6163e15735d66710):
  Copyright 2025 IHP PDK Authors (RM_IHPSG13_1P_64x16_c2.v)
  Copyright 2023 IHP PDK Authors (RM_IHPSG13_1P_core_behavioral.v)
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
models/blackbox/RM_IHPSG13_1P_64x16_c2.v is an interface-only derivative of the
first model. See models/NOTICE.IHP-Open-PDK and models/LICENSE.IHP-Open-PDK.

The fabricated design instantiates IHP RM_IHPSG13_1P_64x16_c2 SRAM hard macros
from the IHP-Open-PDK (Apache License, Version 2.0).
